#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:5
msgid "class CAN -- Controller Area Network protocol"
msgstr "kelas CAN -- Protokol Controller Area Network"

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:7
msgid ""
"CAN is a two-wire serial protocol used for reliable real-time message "
"delivery between one or more nodes connected to a common bus. CAN 2.0 was "
"standardised in ISO-11898, and is now also known as CAN Classic."
msgstr ""
"CAN adalah protokol serial dua kabel yang digunakan untuk pengiriman pesan "
"real-time yang andal antara satu atau lebih node yang terhubung ke bus "
"bersama. CAN 2.0 telah distandarisasi dalam ISO-11898, dan sekarang juga "
"dikenal sebagai CAN Classic."

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:11
msgid ""
"There is also a newer, backwards compatible, protocol named CAN FD (CAN with"
" Flexible Data-Rate). The :class:`machine.CAN` driver does not currently "
"support CAN FD features; use :class:`pyb.CAN` on STM32 if you need CAN FD."
msgstr ""
"Ada juga protokol yang lebih baru dan kompatibel mundur, bernama CAN FD (CAN"
" dengan Flexible Data-Rate). Driver :class:`machine.CAN` saat ini tidak "
"mendukung fitur CAN FD; gunakan :class:`pyb.CAN` pada STM32 jika Anda "
"memerlukan CAN FD."

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:16
msgid ""
"CAN support requires a controller (often an internal microcontroller "
"peripheral), and an external transceiver to level-shift the signals onto the"
" CAN bus."
msgstr ""
"Dukungan CAN memerlukan sebuah kontroler (seringkali periferal "
"mikrokontroler internal), dan transceiver eksternal untuk menggeser level "
"sinyal ke bus CAN."

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:20
msgid ""
"Available on STM32 OpenMV cams (M4 / M7 / H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal / N6, "
"plus the Arduino-branded variants that wire a transceiver). Not yet "
"supported on the OpenMV Cam RT1062 (mimxrt port) or the OpenMV Cam AE3 (alif"
" port)."
msgstr ""
"Tersedia pada OpenMV cam STM32 (M4 / M7 / H7 / H7 Plus / Pure Thermal / N6, "
"plus varian bermerek Arduino yang menghubungkan transceiver). Belum didukung"
" pada OpenMV Cam RT1062 (port mimxrt) atau OpenMV Cam AE3 (port alif)."

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:25
msgid ""
"The ``machine.CAN`` interface is a *low level basic* CAN messaging interface"
" that abstracts a CAN controller as an outgoing priority queue for sending "
"messages, an incoming queue for receiving messages, and mechanisms for "
"reporting errors."
msgstr ""
"Antarmuka ``machine.CAN`` adalah antarmuka pesan CAN *tingkat rendah dasar* "
"yang mengabstraksi kontroler CAN sebagai antrean prioritas keluar untuk "
"mengirim pesan, antrean masuk untuk menerima pesan, dan mekanisme untuk "
"melaporkan kesalahan."

#: ../../library/machine.CAN.rst:30
msgid ""
"The planned ``can`` and ``aiocan`` micropython-lib modules will be the "
"recommended way to use CAN with MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"Modul ``can`` dan ``aiocan`` micropython-lib yang direncanakan akan menjadi "
"cara yang direkomendasikan untuk menggunakan CAN dengan MicroPython."

